=== PARITY ===
Reads (11) — cache→network feed, web query key → S7 cache key, params snake_case:
  [x] useChargingSessions          -> GET /charging-sessions?vehicle_id=N         key charging-sessions|vehicle|N   decode List<ChargingSession> (safeArray)
  [x] useChargingSession           -> GET /charging/{id}                          key charging-sessions|{id}        decode ChargingSession
  [x] useChargingSessionDetail     -> GET /charging/{id}                          key charging-session|{id}         decode ChargingSession (refetchInterval = UI, not ported)
  [x] useChargeTelemetry           -> GET /charging/{id}/telemetry                key charge-telemetry|{id}         decode List<ChargeTelemetryReading> (safeArray)
  [x] useChargingSessionsPaginated -> GET /charging?limit&offset[&vehicle_id…]    key charging|limit|offset|…       decode List<ChargingSession> (safeArray)
  [x] useCostForecast              -> GET /analytics/cost-forecast?vin&months=6   key cost-forecast|vin|months      raw JsonElement
  [x] useChargingOptimizer         -> GET /analytics/charging-optimizer?vin       key charging-optimizer|vin        raw JsonElement
  [x] useTeslaChargingHistory      -> GET /tesla/charging/history[?vin]           key tesla-charging-history[|vin]  raw JsonElement
  [x] useTeslaChargingSessions     -> GET /tesla/charging/sessions[?vin]          key tesla-charging-sessions[|vin] raw JsonElement
  [x] useChargePlans               -> GET /charge-planner/history?vehicle_id=N     key charge-plans|N                raw JsonElement (safeArray)
  [x] useRatePlans                 -> GET /charge-planner/rate-plans              key charge-planner-rate-plans     raw JsonElement (safeArray)
Mutations (5) — suspend Result<JsonElement> (verbatim SI), store refreshes EXACTLY the
web invalidateQueries set (TanStack prefix semantics, '|' boundary-safe):
  [x] useRefreshTeslaChargingHistory  -> POST /tesla/charging/history/refresh {vin?,start_time?}  invalidate -> tesla-charging-history (family)
  [x] useRefreshTeslaChargingSessions -> POST /tesla/charging/sessions/refresh {vin?,date_from?,date_to?} invalidate -> tesla-charging-sessions (family)
  [x] useOptimizeCharge               -> POST /charge-planner/optimize {OptimizeChargeInput}       invalidate -> none (web does not invalidate)
  [x] useApplySchedule                -> POST /charge-planner/apply {ApplyScheduleInput}           invalidate -> charge-plans (family; sibling rate-plans untouched)
  [x] useBulkDeleteCharging           -> DELETE /charging/bulk {ids:[…]}                            invalidate -> charging-sessions (family; byVehicle + string-id detail, NOT charging-session|id, NOT charging|…)

All 16 ported. SI preserved — mutation responses returned verbatim as JsonElement;
request bodies keep their established snake_case contract names (battery_capacity_kwh,
charger_voltage) which are request knobs, not stored unit-suffixed DB/Go fields, so the
Phase-48 SI-canonical rule (DB columns / Go struct fields) does not apply. Conversion is
display-only (S5). The request() client auto-adds /api/v1; hooks carry no double prefix.

